1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
You have never really held anyone's hand.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,700
Even the people you love the most…

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,300
Let's zoom in. Closer.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,400
Even their skin cells… never touch yours.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,600
Closer still.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,800
Down to the molecules. Still a gap.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,200
At the atoms, electrons push each other away.

8
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,900
They never truly meet.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,900
But here's the beautiful part… you still feel them.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Because closeness was never about touching.

